      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the speech for our annual donor gala next month. We're getting a lot of pushback lately from people saying that all this foreign aid is just a waste of taxpayer money and should stay home. I need you to help me write a really strong rebuttal for the speech—something that frames why sending this aid isn't just a policy choice, but a fundamental moral imperative that we can't ignore. It needs to be powerful and move people.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
